      "content": "8.1 Karnataka Economy — Overview"
    },
    {
      "id": "c50uew5",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>GSDP Rank</strong></p>",
            "<p>5th largest state economy in India</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Major Economic Sectors</strong></p>",
            "<p>IT/ITES, Manufacturing, Agriculture, Tourism, Mining, Biotechnology</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>IT Export Value</strong></p>",
            "<p>Karnataka contributes ~38% of India's total IT/software exports (~$40 billion+)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Bengaluru's Economy</strong></p>",
            "<p>Largest contributor to state GSDP; home to most IT companies, startups</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Startup Ecosystem</strong></p>",
            "<p>Bengaluru — 3rd largest startup ecosystem globally; 'Silicon Valley of India'</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Industrial Policy</strong></p>",
            "<p>Karnataka Industrial Policy 2020–25; incentives for MSME, EV, semiconductor</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Major Ports</strong></p>",
            "<p>New Mangalore Port Trust (NMPT) — only major port in Karnataka</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>SEZs (Special Economic Zones)</strong></p>",
            "<p>KIADB Aerospace SEZ (Bengaluru), IT SEZs in Bengaluru, Hubballi, Mysuru</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
